---
// SchoolForms component - SF-10 & SF-9 integration explained simply
---

<section id="school-forms" class="relative bg-[#09110c] py-24 border-t border-white/5 text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8">

    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">

      <!-- Left: Description -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">School Forms</p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl leading-tight">
          Register students using SF-10 &amp; SF-9 forms.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          TIS RMS uses the official <strong class="text-white">School Form 10 (SF-10)</strong> and <strong class="text-white">School Form 9 (SF-9)</strong> as the fastest way to add student basic information into the system from old documents.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/8 p-4 text-sm text-amber-300 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-amber-200">Note:</strong> TIS RMS is for registering basic student information from historical records (2021 onwards). It is <strong>not an enrollment system</strong> and does not track grades.
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 p-5">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#16a34a]/20 text-[#4ade80] text-lg">1</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white">School Form 10 (SF-10)</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The main source for student basic information — captures name, LRN, birth date, gender, and originating school.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 p-5">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 text-lg">2</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white">School Form 9 (SF-9)</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">A supporting document used to cross-reference student identifiers and school year records from old files.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 p-5">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-400 text-lg">3</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white">Auto-fill SF-10 Spreadsheet</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Once a student is registered, the system can generate a pre-filled official DepEd SF-10 Excel file — ready to submit.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Sample record preview -->
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-[#0c1610] shadow-xl">

        <!-- Window bar -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/5 bg-[#15803d] px-5 py-3">
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>
          <span class="ml-2 text-sm font-medium text-white">Student Registration Form</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Sample data -->
        <div class="p-6 space-y-4">

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/6 bg-white/3 p-4">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#4ade80] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Learner Basic Information</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#09110c] p-3 border border-white/5">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">LRN</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#4ade80]">108297100170</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#09110c] p-3 border border-white/5">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">Full Name</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Garcia, Cris Charles</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#09110c] p-3 border border-white/5">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">Year Level</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400">Grade 7</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#09110c] p-3 border border-white/5">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">School</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Talisay Integrated School</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/6 bg-white/3 p-4 space-y-2.5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Document Fields (from SF-10)</p>
            {[
              ["Date of Birth", "April 14, 2009"],
              ["Sex", "Male"],
              ["Originating School", "Talisay Elementary School"],
              ["Document Source", "SF-10 Archive (2021+)"],
            ].map(([field, value]) => (
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm border-b border-white/5 pb-2 last:border-0 last:pb-0">
                <span class="text-slate-400">{field}</span>
                <span class="text-white font-medium">{value}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-[#16a34a]/10 border border-[#16a34a]/20 p-3.5">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-300">Basic info registration only — <span class="text-white font-medium">no grade tracking</span></span>
            <span class="rounded-lg bg-[#16a34a] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Save Record</span>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
